@startuml certified-metric-execution
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #102027
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowThickness 2

title Certified construction and optimization of metric automata

rectangle "Observation contract\ndomain, arithmetic, snapshot, order, witnesses, limits" as Contract #BBDEFB
rectangle "Reference semantics\nmeasure + residual + session trace" as Reference #E3F2FD
rectangle "Candidate realizations\nspecialized recurrences, layouts, schedulers" as Candidates #D1C4E9
rectangle "Local proof obligations\ntransitions, coverage, numeric bounds, progress" as Proofs #FFF9C4
rectangle "Resource evidence\nwork potential, live bytes, conversion costs" as Resources #FFE0B2
rectangle "Checked correspondence\nproof replay + exact artifact and scope" as Check #B2EBF2
rectangle "Certified feasible portfolio\neach member preserves requested observations" as Portfolio #C8E6C9
rectangle "Selection under declared objective\nmodel optimum / measured workload improvement" as Select #DCEDC8
rectangle "Executable specialization\ntransactional publication and scoped certificates" as Execute #F8BBD0

Contract --> Reference
Contract --> Candidates
Reference --> Proofs
Candidates --> Proofs
Candidates --> Resources
Proofs --> Check
Resources --> Check
Check --> Portfolio : accept only established claims
Portfolio --> Select
Select --> Execute : retain correspondence evidence

note right of Check #FFF9C4
  A hash detects artifact drift.
  A refinement or validated translation
  establishes semantic correspondence.
end note

note bottom of Select #E8F5E9
  State count, work, memory, and latency
  are distinct optimization objectives.
  Summary and conversion costs count.
end note
@enduml
